          "type": "component/the-thread-thread-intro",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "title": "The Thread",
            "text": "A personalized 1:1 mentorship in the art of becoming.",
            "medicine": "A personalized practice of True Nature Alignment."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sec_9jbddd0k0e",
      "preset": "component/the-thread-thresholds@1",
      "label": "Thresholds",
      "anchor": "thresholds",
      "layout": {
        "mode": "stack",
        "columns": {
          "d": [
            12
          ]
        },
        "width": "full"
      },
      "style": {
        "colorTheme": "light",
        "padding": {
          "d": "none"
        }
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_1s7nkn8sns",
          "type": "component/the-thread-thresholds",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "body": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "There are seasons when you know something is changing, but you can't quite name what the next shape is."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Old ways no longer fit. Something is asking to be felt, released, claimed, created or lived differently."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "You may not need another system to follow. You may need space to hear yourself."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The Thread is a private mentorship for those thresholds.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " Together, we listen for what is most alive and follow it."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sec_rkvxm515n9",
      "preset": "component/the-thread-not-a-curriculum@1",
      "label": "You are not a formula.",
      "anchor": "not-a-curriculum",
      "layout": {
        "mode": "stack",
        "columns": {
          "d": [
            12
          ]
        },
        "width": "full"
      },
      "style": {
        "colorTheme": "light",
        "padding": {
          "d": "none"
        }
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_xc0hkn9p3p",
          "type": "component/the-thread-not-a-curriculum",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "kicker": "This is not a curriculum",
            "heading": "You are not a formula.",
            "text": "Your life does not happen in modules. So this work does not begin by deciding which predetermined sequence you should complete. We begin with you.",
            "lines": [
              {
                "lines": "Your present season. Your history. Your body."
              },
              {
                "lines": "Your relationships. Your patterns. Your desires."
              },
              {
                "lines": "Your questions. Your gifts. Your edge."
              }
            ],
            "text2": "Then we weave together the practices most relevant to what wants to happen next."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
